From: Saphira packaging <recipes@saphira.vm2.uk>
Subject: [PATCH] layer2-generator: use neighbor index for neighbor metadata

_cb_l2gen_event indexed neighbor metadata with net_idx (enum
oonf_layer2_network_index) instead of neigh_idx (enum
oonf_layer2_neighbor_index): -Wenum-conversion, and the wrong slot
when the two counts differ. The sibling loop above already uses each
index for its own domain.

--- a/src-plugins/generic/layer2_generator/layer2_generator.c
+++ b/src-plugins/generic/layer2_generator/layer2_generator.c
@@ -246,7 +246,7 @@
   for (neigh_idx = 0; neigh_idx < OONF_LAYER2_NEIGH_COUNT; neigh_idx++) {
-    _set_data(&neigh->data[neigh_idx], oonf_layer2_neigh_metadata_get(net_idx)->type, event_counter);
+    _set_data(&neigh->data[neigh_idx], oonf_layer2_neigh_metadata_get(neigh_idx)->type, event_counter);
   }
   oonf_layer2_neigh_commit(neigh);
 }
